const correctionSections=[['items','Artículos y productos'],['recipes','Recetas'],['lots','Stock y lotes'],['purchases','Ingresos'],['productions','Elaboraciones'],['trials','Pruebas y ensayos'],['sales','Ventas y remitos'],['expenses','Gastos'],['suppliers','Proveedores'],['customers','Clientes de ventas'],['sectors','Sectores'],['transfers','Traslados'],['adjustments','Ajustes y bajas'],['configuration','Empresa y configuración']];
let correctionSection='recipes',correctionQuery='';
const correctionLabels={company:'Nombre de la empresa',name:'Nombre',code:'Código',kind:'Tipo',unit:'Unidad',brand:'Marca',rnpa:'RNPA',salePrice:'Precio minorista',wholesalePrice:'Precio mayorista',supplierId:'Proveedor',supplierIds:'Proveedores habituales',itemId:'Artículo / producto',sectorId:'Sector',customerId:'Cliente',lotId:'Lote',yield:'Rendimiento',shelfLifeDays:'Vida útil (días)',components:'Ingredientes y subproductos',qty:'Cantidad',remaining:'Stock actual',date:'Fecha',expiry:'Vencimiento',unitCost:'Costo unitario',status:'Estado',supplierLot:'Lote del proveedor',manufactured:'Fecha de elaboración',note:'Observaciones',notes:'Observaciones',inputs:'Lotes consumidos',recipe:'Receta utilizada',version:'Versión',batches:'Cantidad de recetas',expectedQty:'Cantidad esperada',taxId:'CUIT',contact:'Contacto',phone:'Teléfono',email:'Correo',address:'Dirección',amount:'Importe',type:'Tipo',from:'Sector de origen',to:'Sector de destino',previousQty:'Saldo anterior',actualQty:'Saldo corregido',delta:'Diferencia',reason:'Motivo',archived:'Archivado',documents:'Documentos',label:'Descripción',delivery:'Remito emitido',deliverySettings:'Datos y plantilla de remito',averages:'Costos promedio',lastStockDate:'Última fecha de stock',counter:'Numeración de lotes',logo:'Logo',businessName:'Razón social',heading:'Título',prefix:'Punto de venta',footer:'Texto al pie',showPrices:'Mostrar precios',purpose:'Motivo del ensayo',trial:'Ensayo',trialMode:'Tipo de ensayo',opening:'Stock inicial',incomplete:'Datos incompletos',pricePending:'Precio pendiente',discountPercent:'Descuento (%)',unitPrice:'Precio unitario',subtotal:'Subtotal',total:'Total',lines:'Productos',number:'Número',createdAt:'Fecha de registro',sourceId:'Registro de origen',sourceVersion:'Versión de origen',internalCode:'Código interno',source:'Origen',clientId:'Empresa de origen',at:'Fecha de importación',importInfo:'Datos de la importación',stockCorrection:'Corrección de stock',retail:'Minorista',wholesale:'Mayorista'};
const correctionTitle=(k)=>correctionLabels[k]||state.items?.find(i=>i.id===k)?.name||k.replace(/([a-z])([A-Z])/g,'$1 $2').replace(/_/g,' ');
function correctionRecordLabel(r,c){if(c==='lots')return lotDescription(r)+(r.code?' · código interno '+r.code:'');return r.name||([name('items',r.itemId),r.date,r.delivery?.number].filter(x=>x&&x!=='—').join(' · '))||r.code||'Registro '+((state[c]||[]).indexOf(r)+1)}
function adminDataScreen(c){
 c.innerHTML='<h2>Corregir datos de '+esc(state.company)+'</h2><p>Solo la cuenta administradora puede usar estas correcciones. Cada cambio queda registrado en el historial.</p><div class="toolbar">'+select('correctionSection','Sección',correctionSections.map(([id,name])=>({id,name})),correctionSection,false)+field('correctionQuery','Buscar','search',correctionQuery)+'</div><div id="correctionRecords"></div>';
 const draw=()=>{const target=$('#correctionRecords');if(correctionSection==='configuration'){target.innerHTML=btn('Editar empresa y configuración','adminCorrect','configuration');return;}
 const records=(state[correctionSection]||[]).filter(r=>searchText(correctionRecordLabel(r,correctionSection)).includes(searchText(correctionQuery)));
 target.innerHTML=rows(['Registro','Detalle','Acción'],records.map(r=>[esc(correctionRecordLabel(r,correctionSection)),esc(correctionSection==='recipes'?'Rendimiento: '+num(r.yield)+' · '+(r.components||[]).length+' componentes':correctionSection==='lots'?'Stock: '+num(r.remaining)+' '+(item(r.itemId)?.unit||''):(r.status||r.date||'')),btn('Corregir','adminCorrect',r.id)+btn('Eliminar','adminRemove',r.id,'danger')]));};
 $('[name=correctionSection]').onchange=e=>{correctionSection=e.target.value;draw()};$('[name=correctionQuery]').oninput=e=>{correctionQuery=e.target.value;draw()};draw();
}
function adminCorrectRecord(recordId){
 const section=recordId==='configuration'?'configuration':correctionSection;
	 let edited=structuredClone(section==='configuration'?Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(state).filter(([,v])=>!Array.isArray(v))):(state[section]||[]).find(r=>sameId(r.id,recordId)));
 if(!edited)throw Error('Registro no encontrado.');
 if(section==='recipes'&&edited.shelfLifeDays===undefined)edited.shelfLifeDays=null;
 const references={itemId:'items',supplierId:'suppliers',customerId:'customers',sectorId:'sectors',lotId:'lots',supplierIds:'suppliers',from:'sectors',to:'sectors'};
 const pathKey=path=>JSON.stringify(path);
 const at=path=>path.reduce((o,k)=>o[k],edited);
 const set=(path,value)=>{let o=edited;for(const k of path.slice(0,-1))o=o[k];o[path.at(-1)]=value};
 function fields(value,path=[],key=''){
  if(key==='data'||key==='id')return '';
  if(Array.isArray(value))return '<fieldset class="full correction-group"><legend>'+esc(correctionTitle(key))+'</legend>'+value.map((v,n)=>'<div class="correction-entry">'+fields(v,[...path,n],key)+(!['documents'].includes(key)?'<button type="button" class="secondary correction-remove" data-path="'+esc(pathKey(path))+'" data-index="'+n+'">Quitar fila '+(n+1)+'</button>':'')+'</div>').join('')+(key!=='documents'?'<button type="button" class="secondary correction-add" data-path="'+esc(pathKey(path))+'">Agregar fila</button>':'')+'</fieldset>';
  if(value&&typeof value==='object')return '<fieldset class="full correction-group"><legend>'+esc(key?correctionTitle(key):'Datos del registro')+'</legend><div class="settings-grid">'+Object.entries(value).map(([k,v])=>fields(v,[...path,k],k)).join('')+'</div></fieldset>';
  if(key==='logo')return '<p>El logo se puede reemplazar desde Configuración de esta empresa.</p>';
  const ref=references[key];let choices=ref?(state[ref]||[]).map(r=>({id:r.id,name:r.name||r.code})):key==='kind'?[['raw','Materia prima'],['packaging','Envase'],['subproduct','Subproducto'],['product','Producto terminado']].map(([id,name])=>({id,name})):key==='unit'?unitOptions:key==='status'?['LIBERADO','BLOQUEADO','RECHAZADO'].map(id=>({id,name:id})):null;
  const attr=' data-correction-path="'+esc(pathKey(path))+'"';
  if(choices)return '<label>'+esc(correctionTitle(key))+'<select'+attr+'><option value="">Sin definir</option>'+choices.map(r=>'<option value="'+esc(r.id)+'"'+(r.id===value?' selected':'')+'>'+esc(r.name)+'</option>').join('')+'</select></label>';
  const type=typeof value==='boolean'?'checkbox':typeof value==='number'||key==='shelfLifeDays'?'number':['date','expiry','manufactured','lastStockDate'].includes(key)?'date':'text';
  if(type==='checkbox')return '<label class="check-option"><input type="checkbox"'+attr+(value?' checked':'')+'>'+esc(correctionTitle(key))+'</label>';
  const text=String(value??'');if(type==='text'&&(text.length>160||['note','notes','footer'].includes(key)))return '<label>'+esc(correctionTitle(key))+'<textarea rows="3"'+attr+'>'+esc(text)+'</textarea></label>';
  return '<label>'+esc(correctionTitle(key))+'<input type="'+type+'"'+attr+' value="'+esc(text)+'"'+(type==='number'?' step="any"':'')+'></label>';
 }
	 function collect(){for(const input of document.querySelectorAll('[data-correction-path]')){const path=JSON.parse(input.dataset.correctionPath),key=path.at(-1),parent=path.at(-2),ref=references[key]||references[parent];let value=input.type==='checkbox'?input.checked:input.type==='number'?(input.value===''?null:Number(input.value)):input.value;if(ref&&input.tagName==='SELECT'&&value)value=(state[ref]||[]).find(r=>sameId(r.id,value))?.id??value;set(path,value);}}
 const content=()=>'<p>Revisá la corrección antes de guardar. Los identificadores internos y el historial de auditoría se conservan.</p>'+fields(edited)+field('correctionReason','Motivo de la corrección','text','','required maxlength="500"');
 modal('Corregir '+(section==='configuration'?'empresa y configuración':correctionRecordLabel(edited,section)),content(),async p=>{collect();return api('admin/correct',{collection:section,recordId,record:edited,version,reason:p.correctionReason})});
 function bind(){
  $('#fields').querySelectorAll('.correction-remove').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{collect();at(JSON.parse(b.dataset.path)).splice(Number(b.dataset.index),1);redraw()});
  $('#fields').querySelectorAll('.correction-add').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{collect();const path=JSON.parse(b.dataset.path),arr=at(path),key=path.at(-1);const sample=arr[0]??(key==='components'?{itemId:'',qty:1}:key==='inputs'?{lotId:'',itemId:'',qty:1,unitCost:0,sectorId:''}:key==='supplierIds'?'':{});const row=structuredClone(sample);if(row&&typeof row==='object'){delete row.id;for(const k of Object.keys(row)){if(typeof row[k]==='number')row[k]=k==='qty'?1:0;else if(typeof row[k]==='string')row[k]='';}}arr.push(row);redraw()});
 }
 function redraw(){const reason=$('[name=correctionReason]').value;$('#fields').innerHTML=content();$('[name=correctionReason]').value=reason;bind();}bind();
}

(async()=>{try{const j=await api('me');user=j.user;storeJSON(offlineUserKey,user);if(user.mustChange)passwordScreen();else{await refresh();syncOfflineQueue().catch(()=>{})}}catch{const cached=savedJSON(offlineUserKey);if(cached){user=cached;offlineMode=true;await refresh()}else login()}})();
